      "label": "Implicit Bias in White Supremacist Context",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the broader context of implicit bias and racial hierarchy, where white people are often held to different standards than people of other races. This is not visible in the image but is implied by the text, which suggests that a white person's act of stealing is more significant or noteworthy.",
